        "The cultists didn't find the lava lake. They found what lives in it. Taragaman the Hungerer is an elemental older than this city, and for ten thousand years he's done nothing but burn and wait. Someone has been feeding him, binding him, and pointing him at Orgrimmar, and I won't have a bound spirit of that size waiting under my city like a fuse. Ragefire Chasm opens in the south-west corner of the city, so follow the west wall south from this hold until the ground turns warm, and beyond the antechamber you'll find the lake with two stone bridges across it and Taragaman where they cross.",
