        "Every cult needs a blade, and the Searing Blade's is a trogg-hater named Bazzalan. He sits on an obsidian throne at the end of the chasm, in a hall that was an orc shrine before it was theirs. He doesn't shout and he doesn't pose. He waits for you to look at the wrong corner of the room, and I'd rather you went to him than waited for him to come to me. Go back into Ragefire Chasm, in the south-west corner of the city, past the Invoker's ritual hall to his walkway, and cut through his Searing Blade Fanatics to reach him.",
        'Take your time and your healers. A cult is a body, and Bazzalan is the knife it holds in the dark.',
